@format 1
@id keyframes.scan
@title Scan nearby keyframes
@area Keyframes
@entry input
@summary Load cached keyframes for a source, concurrently scan the centre and both directional ranges around the cursor, and publish source-current results.
@flow TB
@related keyframes.previous, keyframes.next, keyframes.suspend

@alias key = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LKeyframeOrchestrator

[input] Keyframes requested <input>
- Receive source, duration, and current cursor @ key.LKeyframeStart(...)
> source

[source] Establish source state <process>
- Replace state and load cache when source identity changes @ key.LKeyframeCacheLoad(...)
- Cancel obsolete scanning and publish currently known keyframes @ key.LKeyframeNoticePublish(...)
> plan

[plan] Plan nearby spans <process>
- Divide the search range around the cursor into centre, backward, and forward spans @ key.LKeyframePlanStart(...)
> concurrent

[concurrent] Start three scan paths <process>
- Start the centre span and independent backward and forward directional scans concurrently @ key.LKeyframePlanRun(...)
> scan

[scan] Scan each path's spans <external>
- Scan the centre once; each directional path scans its spans sequentially @ key.LKeyframeSpanRun(...)
- Merge discovered keyframes, publish each completed attempt, and cache at the save threshold @ key.LKeyframeSpanRun(...)
> outcome

[outcome] Finish the request <decision>
? "Work is current" > persist
? "Work is cancelled or stale" > discarded

[persist] Cache and publish <storage>
- Persist the keyframe sidecar after all three paths finish @ key.LKeyframeSidecarPersist(...)
- Failed spans are counted but not retried in this request; later requests may scan them until the retry limit @ key.LKeyframeSpanRun(...)
> result

[result] Keyframes available <output>
= Current cached and newly scanned keyframes are available for navigation and display.

[discarded] Scan discarded <output>
= Cancelled or stale work does not replace the active source state.
